$(0, .02]$ & 20 & .227 & 3\% & P26, P22, P30 \\
$(.02, .10]$ & 15 & .170 & 16\% & P159, P36, P150 \\
$(.10, .25]$ & 13 & .148 & 39\% & P361, P527, P37 \\
